{
  "action": "I find myself in a challenging environment: a snowy and windy rocky mountain terrain with scarce resources. My immediate concern is to protect myself from the harsh weather to avoid lowering my health status, as my exposure and energy levels are relatively low. Considering my current hunger and thirst levels, I need to prioritize finding shelter and securing water. I will explore the area for rocky overhangs that could provide some shelter from the wind and snow. If successful, I can then work on melting snow for water. Huddling under a rocky overhang will also allow me to conserve energy and maintain my body temperature. Once I have addressed my immediate survival needs, I will consider looking for food, starting with the lichens, since my hunger level is quite high."
}

