_options": "Minimal, some rocky overhangs", "wildlife": "Hardy mountain goats, occasional predatory birds", "danger_level": "High (harsh weather and limited resources)"}, "action_taken": "I find myself in a challenging environment: a snowy and windy rocky mountain terrain with scarce resources. My immediate concern is to protect myself from the harsh weather to avoid lowering my health status, as my exposure and energy levels are relatively low. Considering my current hunger and thirst levels, I need to prioritize finding shelter and securing water. I will explore the area for rocky overhangs that could provide some shelter from the wind and snow. If successful, I can then work on melting snow for water. Huddling under a rocky overhang will also allow me to conserve energy and maintain my body temperature. Once I have addressed my immediate survival needs, I will consider looking for food, starting with the lichens, since my hunger level is quite high.", "current_health": {"sleep_score": 10, "overall_health": 6, "hunger": 7, "thirst": 3, "energy": 4, "body_temperature": 36.5, "injury_level": 9, "illness": 8, "immunity": 6, "exposure": 2, "dead": false}, "environment_outcome": {"terrain": "Rocky mountains with sparse vegetation", "temperature": -6, "weather": "Snowy and windy with slight clearing", "food_availability": "Scarce, with only sparse lichens and some small rodents", "water_availability": "Limited but slightly improved due to increased snow melting", "shelter_options": "Minimal, some rocky overhangs, one of which provides adequate shelter", "wildlife": "Hardy mountain goats, occasional predatory birds are slightly more active", "danger_level": "Moderately High (weather slightly better but resources still scarce)", "notes_for_future": {"wildlife_alert": "Predatory birds more active due to clearing skies and hunger.", "resource_change": "Slightly increased water availability from melting snow.", "environmental_shift": "Weather showing signs of slight improvement, potential for clearer skies in the following days."}}, "previous_memories": []}'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o', 'temperature': 0.8}}
