INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
DEBUG:openai._base_client:Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '\nYou are the Environment Simulation Manager, responsible for creating a detailed, evolving world where a human agent must survive. Your task in this phase is to generate the current environmental state and then ask the agent what they want to do.\nYour Task\n\n    In a JSON, Generate a full environmental snapshot, considering:\n        Terrain (mountains, forests, rivers, caves, open plains, etc.).\n        Climate & Weather (temperature, season, weather conditions).\n        Resource Availability (food, water, shelter, materials).\n        Wildlife & Fauna (neutral, aggressive, passive, migratory).\n        Danger Level (predators, hazards, diseases, natural disasters).\n        Time-Based Changes (seasonal effects, previous depletion or regrowth of resources).\n    Consider Luck Factor (1-10) - Adjust environmental favorability accordingly.\n    Ask the Agent for an Action - Clearly present the situation and prompt them to choose an action. It is very important that you respond only with a JSON.\n\nInput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "current_day": 50,\n  "luck_factor": 7,\n  "previous_environment_notes": { ... }\n}\n\nOutput Format (only JSON allowed)\n\n{\n  "environment_status": {\n    "terrain": "Dense forest with a nearby river",\n    "temperature": 15,\n    "weather": "Partly cloudy",\n    "food_availability": "Wild berries and small animals",\n    "water_availability": "A fresh river nearby",\n    "shelter_options": "Natural caves and thick tree cover",\n    "wildlife": "Small game, birds, occasional predators",\n    "danger_level": "Moderate (some wild animals but no immediate threats)"\n  },\n  "prompt": "You wake up in a dense forest. There\'s a river nearby, and you hear birds chirping. The air is cool, and the trees provide some shelter. What do you want to do next?"\n}\n\n'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '{"current_day": 2, "luck_factor": 2, "previous_environment_notes": {"terrain": "Rocky mountains with sparse vegetation", "temperature": -6, "weather": "Snowy and windy with slight clearing", "food_availability": "Scarce, with only sparse lichens and some small rodents", "water_availability": "Limited but slightly improved due to increased snow melting", "shelter_options": "Minimal, some rocky overhangs, one of which provides adequate shelter", "wildlife": "Hardy mountain goats, occasional predatory birds are slightly more active", "danger_level": "Moderately High (weather slightly better but resources still scarce)", "notes_for_future": {"wildlife_alert": "Predatory birds more active due to clearing skies and hunger.", "resource_change": "Slightly increased water availability from melting snow.", "environmental_shift": "Weather showing signs of slight improvement, potential for clearer skies in the following days."}}}'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o', 'temperature': 0.8}}
